---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /precast-concrete-molds/index.html
pageType: precast-moulds
title: Precast Concrete Moulds & Formwork | Realjet
seoTitle: Precast Concrete Moulds & Steel Formwork | Realjet
description: Explore project-specific steel moulds and formwork for precast bridge, building, tunnel, municipal and custom concrete components.
canonical: https://realjetech.com/precast-concrete-molds/
socialImage: https://realjetech.com/images/products/high-precision-hydraulic-formwork.webp
robots: index, follow
---
<article class="moulds-landing">
  <section class="moulds-hero">
    <div class="container moulds-hero-grid">
      <div class="moulds-hero-copy">
        <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Precast Concrete Moulds</span></nav>
        <span class="eyebrow">Project-Specific Steel Mould Systems</span>
        <h1>Precast Concrete Moulds &amp; Formwork</h1>
        <p>Reusable steel mould systems engineered around the component geometry, casting sequence, production layout and project requirements of each precast operation.</p>
        <div class="moulds-hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="#mould-categories" data-mould-cta="explore_categories">Explore Categories <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <a class="button button-outline" href="#mould-enquiry" data-mould-cta="hero_enquiry">Request a Technical Review <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
        <ul class="moulds-proof-list" aria-label="Planning basis">
          <li>Factory or casting-yard use</li>
          <li>Mechanical or hydraulic operation</li>
          <li>Made to approved drawings</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="moulds-hero-media">
        <img src="/images/products/high-precision-hydraulic-formwork.webp" alt="Large fabricated steel formwork with hydraulic operating equipment in a precast production facility" width="1200" height="675" decoding="async" />
        <span>Placeholder image — product photography can be replaced in the content system.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="mould-categories" class="moulds-categories" aria-labelledby="mould-categories-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="moulds-section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Five Application Categories</span><h2 id="mould-categories-title">Browse the complete 16-product mould range.</h2></div></div>
      <div class="mould-category-grid">
        {% for category in precastMouldCatalog.categories %}
        {% set categoryProducts = precastMouldCatalog.products | mouldProductsForCategory(category.slug) %}
        <a class="mould-category-card" href="#{{ category.slug }}" data-mould-category="{{ category.slug }}">
          <span class="mould-category-number">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
          <h3>{{ category.name }}</h3>
          <p>{{ category.description }}</p>
          <ul>{% for mouldProduct in categoryProducts %}<li>{{ mouldProduct.title }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
          <b>{{ categoryProducts.length }} products <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></b>
        </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mould-catalogue" aria-labelledby="mould-catalogue-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading mould-catalogue-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Product Catalogue</span><h2 id="mould-catalogue-title">16 mould systems organised by application.</h2></div>
      {% for category in precastMouldCatalog.categories %}
      {% set categoryProducts = precastMouldCatalog.products | mouldProductsForCategory(category.slug) %}
      <section class="mould-category-products" id="{{ category.slug }}" aria-labelledby="{{ category.slug }}-title">
        <div class="mould-category-products-heading"><div><span>0{{ loop.index }}</span><h3 id="{{ category.slug }}-title">{{ category.name }}</h3></div><a class="text-link" href="/precast-concrete-molds/{{ category.slug }}/">View category <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
        <div class="mould-products-grid">{% for mouldProduct in categoryProducts %}{% include "components/mould-product-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}</div>
      </section>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="mould-enquiry" class="mould-enquiry" aria-labelledby="mould-enquiry-title">
    <div class="container mould-enquiry-shell" data-mould-inquiry-container>
      <div class="mould-enquiry-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Project Enquiry</span>
        <h2 id="mould-enquiry-title">Send the component type and available drawings.</h2>
        <p>Realjet will review the mould geometry, operating sequence, production target and factory or casting-yard interfaces before defining the technical scope.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-mould-inquiry-shell>
        <form name="precast-mould-enquiry" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="bot-field" data-mould-inquiry-form>
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="precast-mould-enquiry" />
          <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="Precast mould project enquiry" />
          <p class="honeypot"><label>Do not fill this field <input name="bot-field" /></label></p>
          <fieldset>
            <label><span>Business Email *</span><input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="name@company.com" required /></label>
            <label><span>Component and Project Requirements *</span><textarea name="project_requirements" rows="4" maxlength="4000" placeholder="Component type, drawings or dimensions, quantity, target cycle, project country and required delivery schedule" required></textarea></label>
            <label class="privacy-field"><input type="checkbox" name="privacy_acknowledgement" value="Privacy policy acknowledged" required /><span>I have read the <a href="/marketing/privacy/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a> and understand that Realjet will use my information to respond to this enquiry.</span></label>
            <p class="form-error" role="alert" data-mould-inquiry-error hidden>Submission failed. Please try again or email sales@realjetech.com.</p>
            <button class="button button-primary" type="submit" data-mould-inquiry-submit>Send Requirements <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          </fieldset>
        </form>
      </div>
      <div class="mould-enquiry-success" data-mould-inquiry-success hidden tabindex="-1" role="status"><span class="success-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><div><h2>Enquiry Sent</h2><p>Thank you. A Realjet specialist will review the information and contact you.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>
